today's commute was insane. the roundabout at the canal was completely locked: every car in the circle was waiting for the car in front of it to move, and that one was waiting for the next, all the way around. nobody could go forward and nobody would back up. a traffic warden finally made two cars reverse into the service lane and the whole thing untangled in two minutes. 55 minutes for a 9 km trip. leaving at 7:15 from now on.
